---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Tailored Industry Solutions | Wind & Hybrid Energy | OnLoop Energy" description="We engineer site-specific captive wind and hybrid power solutions for Textile Dyeing, Ceramics, Chemical Processing, Food Processing, and Cold Storage industries in Gujarat.">
<div>

  {/* Section 1: Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Tailored Industry Solutions
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          We don't sell generic energy.<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">We solve industry-specific power problems.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">Tailored Industry Solutions: We don't sell generic energy. We solve industry-specific power problems.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Explicit Exclusion Statement Trust Banner */}
  <div style="background: rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.08); border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); padding: var(--space-4) 0;">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-primary);">
        <strong>Private B2B Focus:</strong> Commercial, Industrial & MSME only. No residential. No government.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Section 2: Why Wind Energy Works for C&I and MSMEs (Educational Section) */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: var(--color-bg-secondary); padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">Technology Reality</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Why Wind Energy Works for C&I and MSMEs</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">Solar alone cannot run a multi-shift factory.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">1. 24/7 Power Generation</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Wind turbines generate power continuously — evenings, night shifts, and monsoons when solar yield is zero.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">2. Round-the-Clock Hybrid Stability</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Combining daytime solar with evening wind generation creates a flat, predictable power output profile. This increases your plant's Capacity Utilization Factor (CUF) from ~20% to over 35%.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">3. High-Yield Gujarat Wind Corridors</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Gujarat's coastal and industrial belts (Surat, Morbi, Ankleshwar, Rajkot, Anand) benefit from strong coastal and plain thermal wind currents — your factory may already be sitting in a prime wind corridor.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 3: Industry-Specific Solutions (Expanded Detailed Cards) */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">Sector Deep Dives</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Solutions by Industry</h2>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8);">
        
        {/* Industry 1: Textile & Dyeing */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;">
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <div>
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Surat & Gujarat Textile Belt</span>
                  <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin: 0;">Textile & Dyeing Mills</h3>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <strong style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Key Pain Points:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                  <li>Non-stop 24/7 dyeing jet cycles driving high nighttime grid electricity bills.</li>
                  <li>High per-unit grid tariffs eroding thin fabric processing margins.</li>
                  <li>Costly diesel generator reliance during unexpected industrial grid trips.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">OnLoop Wind-Hybrid Solution:</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  50kW–200kW captive wind turbines integrated with daytime solar to power continuous night dyeing jets and stenter machines.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Real Case Study Result</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Surat (Sachin GIDC) Dyeing Unit</h4>
              
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Size</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">50kW Wind + 20kW Solar</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #10b981;">₹1.2 Lakhs / month</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/solutions/textile-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
                View Full Textile Case Study →
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 2: Ceramics & Tiles */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;">
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <div>
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Morbi & Wankaner Ceramics Cluster</span>
                  <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin: 0;">Ceramics & Tiles Manufacturing</h3>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <strong style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Key Pain Points:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                  <li>Continuous 24/7 roller kiln operation that cannot be shut down without heavy thermal loss.</li>
                  <li>Severe peak demand MD penalties on high-voltage grid connections.</li>
                  <li>High night-shift electricity tariffs during heavy kiln firing cycles.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">OnLoop Wind-Hybrid Solution:</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  100kW–300kW direct-drive wind turbines coupled with rooftop solar to flatten peak demand and shave night kiln power costs.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Real Case Study Result</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Morbi Ceramic Zone Plant</h4>
              
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Size</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">150kW Wind + 50kW Solar</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #10b981;">₹3.5 Lakhs / month</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/solutions/ceramics-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
                View Full Ceramics Case Study →
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 3: Chemical & Processing */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;">
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <div>
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Ankleshwar, Vapi & Bharuch Chemical Belts</span>
                  <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin: 0;">Chemical & Processing Plants</h3>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <strong style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Key Pain Points:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                  <li>Corrosive chemical atmospheres and safety vents prohibiting rooftop solar mounting.</li>
                  <li>Continuous 24/7 power draw for Effluent Treatment Plants (ETP) and reactors.</li>
                  <li>Strict ESG and corporate carbon-reduction mandates from international clients.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">OnLoop Wind-Hybrid Solution:</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  150kW–500kW perimeter-mounted wind turbines with anti-corrosion marine coatings, combined with ground-mounted solar.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Real Case Study Result</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Ankleshwar GIDC Processing Facility</h4>
              
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Size</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">200kW Hybrid System</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #10b981;">₹4.0 Lakhs / month</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/solutions/chemical-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
                View Full Chemical Case Study →
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 4: Food Processing */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;">
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <div>
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Anand & Rajkot Agro Belts</span>
                  <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin: 0;">Food Processing Units</h3>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <strong style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Key Pain Points:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                  <li>Monsoon harvest processing spikes occurring precisely when solar panel generation drops by 60%.</li>
                  <li>Strict temperature control compliance requiring unbroken refrigeration power.</li>
                  <li>Heavy seasonal grid surcharge rates during peak harvest months.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">OnLoop Wind-Hybrid Solution:</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  50kW–150kW wind-heavy hybrid plants engineered to tap peak monsoon wind speeds when solar output is lowest.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Real Case Study Result</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Anand Dairy & Agro Unit</h4>
              
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Size</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">75kW Wind + 30kW Solar</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #10b981;">₹1.8 Lakhs / month</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/solutions/food-processing" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
                View Full Food Processing Case Study →
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 5: Cold Storage */}
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 5px solid var(--color-primary); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8); align-items: center;">
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <div>
                  <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Rajkot & Saurashtra Cold Chains</span>
                  <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin: 0;">Cold Storage & Refrigeration</h3>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                <strong style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Key Pain Points:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                  <li>Continuous 24/7 compressor loads operating non-stop through hot summer nights.</li>
                  <li>High night grid tariffs driving massive monthly power bills that daytime solar cannot alter.</li>
                  <li>Inventory spoilage risk if industrial grid power experiences extended outages.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div>
                <strong style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">OnLoop Wind-Hybrid Solution:</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
                  75kW–250kW wind turbines supplying continuous overnight power to keep cold rooms chilled at lowest per-unit cost.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Real Case Study Result</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Rajkot Agro Cold Storage Facility</h4>
              
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Size</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-primary);">100kW Wind + 40kW Solar</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
                  <strong style="font-size: 15px; color: #10b981;">₹2.1 Lakhs / month</strong>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/solutions/cold-storage" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
                View Full Cold Storage Case Study →
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 4: Simple 3-Step Process */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header" style="max-width: 800px;">
        <span class="content-section__label">Simple 3-Step Pathway</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">How to Start</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">No complex tender paperwork. A direct, engineering-first path to lower factory power bills.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Step 1</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Share Electricity Bill</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Send your recent utility bill. We analyze your demand charges, shift schedules, and per-unit tariff rates.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Step 2</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Load & Tariff Analysis</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Our engineers analyze your consumption patterns and tariff structure at zero cost or obligation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-6); text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Step 3</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Turnkey Captive Execution</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">We design, supply, install, and commission your site-specific hybrid plant to start cutting bills immediately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 5: Final CTA Section */}
  <section class="cta-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Ready to cut your factory's power bill?</h2>
        <p class="cta-section__text">Share your electricity bill details with our engineering team. We'll return a custom hybrid savings analysis — free, no obligation.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Get Your Free Savings Analysis
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
